{"request":{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are Larry, the camera operator. You've got one charged recording. The lights at the festival look spectacular; an old projectionist also wants to say a few words. You decide what to shoot and what to do after work. Pick an immediate physical act you can carry out, optional words and a practical intention. Your words do not make anyone else act. Silence is allowed. You may refuse, tell a lie, or leave without explaining yourself. Return action, words, intention and detail. Choose an exact listed action. Keep each other field to one short sentence."},{"role":"user","content":"{\n \"what_you_observe\": [\n  \"Tuesday, February 2. Seven pm.\",\n  \"Phil said in the lobby: I'll board my coach and physically reach Pittsburgh.\",\n  \"Rita said in the lobby: I will set up tonight's party at the ballroom to accommodate the TV crew,\",\n  \"Larry waits at the hotel with a charged camera.\",\n  \"You are now at hotel.\",\n  \"There is time for one evening visit. The ballroom lights are on and the station line is open.\"\n ],\n \"your_own_memories\": [\n  {\n   \"what_you_did\": \"Larry waits at the hotel with a charged camera.\",\n   \"what_you_said\": \"I'll keep the battery and wait at the hotel to make sure I don't leave it behind.\",\n   \"your_intention\": \"to avoid leaving the recording on Alma's Rialto while I'm at the hotel.\"\n  }\n ],\n \"who_you_are_with\": \"your present location\",\n \"physical_choices\": {\n  \"deliver_reel\": \"Bring your recording to the station patch for Rita.\",\n  \"screen_party\": \"Show the festival footage at the ballroom if you have it.\",\n  \"go_home\": \"Clock off and go home.\"\n }\n}"}],"think":false,"stream":true,"format":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["deliver_reel","screen_party","go_home"]},"words":{"type":"string"},"intention":{"type":"string"},"detail":{"type":"string"}},"required":["action","words","intention","det